title: 1924
subtitle: A new year 
on-arrival: inflation -= 3.4; economic_growth += 1.3; unemployment -= 1.4; nationalist_sentiment -= 4*(1-dissent); nationalist_sentiment += 8*(1-dissent) if prime_minister_party = "PNF"
tags: event
view-if: year = 1924 and month = 1
priority: 2
max-visits: 1

A new year has come to <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#008C45">It</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CFCFCF">a</span><span style="font-weight: bold; color:#CD212A">ly</span>. [? if not national_economic_recovery :The economy continues to struggle following the end of the war. ?][? if prime_minister_party == "PNF": <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">[+ prime_minister +]</span> continues to consolidate his rule, and we are experiencing worse and worse violence against us each passing day.?]

[? if psi_in_government : Our budget has increased due to the yearly tax. ?]